# Noto Sans CJK JP (SIL OFL 1.1) is fetched on demand — keeping the binary
# out of git keeps the repo small. Download instructions live in this
# directory's README. The xtask `include_bytes!`'s the file from here at
# build time, so `cargo run -p xtask-generate-test-pdfs` will fail with a
# helpful message until the file is present.
NotoSansCJKjp-Regular.otf
